---
/**
 * A passthrough.
 *
 * Starlight splits main and the table of contents into two columns here, with its own flex rules and a
 * media query. `<cs-page>` does that with its `aside` slot, and the slot has to be a direct child of the
 * element — so `PageFrame.astro` renders the table of contents and this component has nothing left to do
 * but pass the main content through. The `right-sidebar` slot Starlight fills is intentionally dropped;
 * ignoring it here is what stops the table of contents rendering twice.
 */
---

<slot />
